      "text": "RSM Bedrijfskunde includes a dense compulsory sequence in business functions and a 7-EC track-linked bachelor project. The UCR programmes offer related business study but do not reproduce the complete HRM, management-accounting, operations, supply-chain, simulation or track/project structure. Technical sustainability and AI courses contribute specific applications. Partial row matches indicate related content, with differences in scope and credits."
